## ðŸ“Š Grading System: Philippine University Standard
| Grade | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| 1.00 | Excellent |
| 1.25 | Very Good |
| 1.50 | Good |
| 1.75 | Fair |
| 2.00 - 3.00 | Passing |
| > 3.00 | Failing |
| 5.00 | Failed |
| INC | Incomplete |

## âš ï¸ CRITICAL: Any numerical grade higher than 3.00 is a FAILING grade.

## ðŸ“… Attendance Rule
- 3 unexcused absences in a single subject per semester = Automatic 5.00 (Failed)

